@Gateway = http://localhost:5000
@Token = replace-with-access-token

### List wallets
GET {{Gateway}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Open TRY wallet
POST {{Gateway}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "TRY"
}

### Deposit with an idempotency reference
POST {{Gateway}}/api/wallet/TRY/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1250.50,
  "transactionRef": "{{$guid}}"
}
Accept: application/json

###
